{"unit_id":"Bxfjjb__Deepseek-Harness-plug#card-zh","repo":"Bxfjjb/Deepseek-Harness-plug","commit":"2dbf58af89f0e7b43cde3010b4c5fa2c0457f231","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-stage-router 是 DSH 的模型阶段路由插件，会在模型请求前检查当前会话状态。规划模式活跃时使用 flash；会话调用写入、编辑、批准计划或委托类工具后，后续请求改用 pro；没有阶段信号时保留 agent 当前模型。触发实施阶段的工具名单可以配置，阶段状态按会话保存在进程内。适合希望按工作阶段切换模型的 DSH Web 用户；默认模型为 deepseek-v4-flash 和 deepseek-v4-pro，无需额外账号或密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:28-75","cordis.patch.yml:1-7"]}
{"unit_id":"Bxfjjb__Deepseek-Harness-plug#card-en","repo":"Bxfjjb/Deepseek-Harness-plug","commit":"2dbf58af89f0e7b43cde3010b4c5fa2c0457f231","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-stage-router selects a model by session stage: flash during plan mode, pro after a configured mutating tool runs, and otherwise the current model. Trigger tools are configurable; state is kept per session in memory. Defaults are deepseek-v4-flash and deepseek-v4-pro.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:28-75","cordis.patch.yml:1-7"]}
