{"unit_id":"Bxfjjb__Deepseek-Harness-plug#feature-1","repo":"Bxfjjb/Deepseek-Harness-plug","commit":"2dbf58af89f0e7b43cde3010b4c5fa2c0457f231","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-stage-router 的功能「规划阶段使用 flash」：每次模型请求前检查 plan mode 状态；若该 agent 的计划模式处于 active，就将本次请求模型设为配置的 flashModel。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:49-66"]}
{"unit_id":"Bxfjjb__Deepseek-Harness-plug#feature-2","repo":"Bxfjjb/Deepseek-Harness-plug","commit":"2dbf58af89f0e7b43cde3010b4c5fa2c0457f231","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-stage-router 的功能「实施阶段切换 pro」：会话调用默认的写入、编辑、计划批准或委托工具后被标记为实施中；之后该会话的模型请求使用配置的 proModel。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:18-26","index.mjs:38-46","index.mjs:68-70"]}
{"unit_id":"Bxfjjb__Deepseek-Harness-plug#feature-3","repo":"Bxfjjb/Deepseek-Harness-plug","commit":"2dbf58af89f0e7b43cde3010b4c5fa2c0457f231","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-stage-router 的功能「配置路由模型和触发工具」：通过插件 config 指定 flashModel、proModel 和 mutatingTools；未配置时使用内置模型名及默认触发工具名单。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:16-31","cordis.patch.yml:5-7"]}
{"unit_id":"Bxfjjb__Deepseek-Harness-plug#caveat-1","repo":"Bxfjjb/Deepseek-Harness-plug","commit":"2dbf58af89f0e7b43cde3010b4c5fa2c0457f231","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-stage-router 使用进程内的 WeakSet 记录每个会话是否进入实施阶段；进程重启后状态会重置，且规划模式优先于实施状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:33-35","index.mjs:55-70"]}
